<Policy title="About The MoneyGoal" description="Learn who operates The MoneyGoal, how our financial education is produced, what our Alice Blue relationship means and how to contact us.">
<p>The MoneyGoal publishes free explanations and calculators for people learning how money works. We cover global concepts and identify India and United States rules separately.</p>
<h2>Publisher and operator</h2><p>Sathya Sankar operates The MoneyGoal. {credentialLine()} That relationship is a commercial relationship, not a qualification to provide personalised investment advice.</p>
<h2>How articles are made</h2><p>Articles identify AI assistance and link to supporting documents. Automated verification checks sources, calculations and publishing rules. They can miss errors. A byline identifying The MoneyGoal means the publication is responsible for the page; it does not imply a qualified person reviewed it.</p><p><a href="/methodology">Read the full publishing method</a> and <a href="/corrections">corrections policy</a>.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>For a correction or publication question, use <a href="https://github.com/yojika-systems/the-money-goal/issues/new?template=correction.yml">our public correction form on GitHub</a>. A GitHub account is required; reports are public. Include the page and the disputed statement, with a supporting source. Do not include account numbers, identity documents or private financial information.</p><p>We do not provide support for provider accounts. Contact the provider directly for account access, applications and complaints.</p>
<h2>Commercial relationships</h2><p><a href="/affiliate-disclosure">How affiliate links work</a> · <a href="/partner">Alice Blue relationship in detail</a>.</p>
</Policy>
